  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Audio Triggers**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting an audio system using the Web Audio API to create subtle, high-quality sounds for droplet interactions. I\'m prioritizing realistic impact sounds for droplet launches, impacts, and merges to significantly enhance the overall tactile water experience for the user.\n\n\n**Refining Audio Synthesis**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the nuances of synthesizing water droplet sounds using the Web Audio API. I\'m focusing on the frequency sweeps and decay envelopes for the \"drip,\" \"launch,\" and \"impact\" sounds. Specifically, I am working on the exponential decay of the sine waves and their respective frequency ranges for a more authentic auditory experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Sound Logic**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the specific sounds: gentle bounces will have resonant splashes, while hard flings will produce deeper ones. I\'m also planning a soft, descending tone for merging, and a tiny plink for window taps. I am going to have the audio initialize on first user input to avoid autoplay issues. I\'ll make sure to add a subtle volume, and a limiter so sounds don\'t overlap or create ear fatigue. Finally, I will place the audio synthesizer in a dedicated module.\n\n\n**Analyzing Sound Synthesis**\n\nI\'m now outlining sound events, including launch, snap, impact, merge, and ripple effects. I\'m focusing on frequency sweeps, resonance, and velocity sensitivity to produce distinct sounds using a variety of sine and noise elements. My next step will be to implement and test these with the Web Audio API, drawing on acoustic principles to ensure authentic sound generation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7407330800036262514"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\n// Web Audio API synthesizer for tactile, organic water droplet acoustics\\nlet audioCtx: AudioContext | null = null;\\nlet lastImpactTime = 0;\\n\\nfunction getAudioContext(): AudioContext | null {\\n  if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return null;\\n  if (!audioCtx) {\\n    const AudioContextClass =\\n      window.AudioContext ||\\n      (window as unknown as { webkitAudioContext: typeof AudioContext }).webkitAudioContext;\\n    if (AudioContextClass) {\\n      audioCtx = new AudioContextClass();\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (audioCtx && audioCtx.state === \'suspended\') {\\n    audioCtx.resume().catch(() => {});\\n  }\\n  return audioCtx;\\n}\\n\\n// Ensure audio context is ready on user gesture\\nexport function initAudioOnGesture() {\\n  getAudioContext();\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * High-quality droplet pop/bloop:\\n * Characteristic Minnaert bubble resonance with exponential pitch glide and subtle harmonics\\n */\\nfunction playDropletTone(options: {\\n  startFreq: number;\\n  endFreq: number;\\n  duration: number;\\n  volume: number;\\n  harmonicRatio?: number;\\n  harmonicGain?: number;\\n}) {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n  const {\\n    startFreq,\\n    endFreq,\\n    duration,\\n    volume,\\n    harmonicRatio = 1.82,\\n    harmonicGain = 0.22,\\n  } = options;\\n\\n  const now = ctx.currentTime;\\n\\n  // Master gain node\\n  const masterGain = ctx.createGain();\\n  masterGain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, now);\\n  masterGain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(volume, now + 0.005);\\n  masterGain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, now + duration);\\n\\n  // Soft low-pass filter to remove any harsh digital edge\\n  const filter = ctx.createBiquadFilter();\\n  filter.type = \'lowpass\';\\n  filter.frequency.setValueAtTime(Math.max(startFreq, endFreq) * 2.2, now);\\n  filter.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(startFreq * 1.2, now + duration);\\n\\n  // Primary bubble oscillator (sine wave)\\n  const osc1 = ctx.createOscillator();\\n  osc1.type = \'sine\';\\n  osc1.frequency.setValueAtTime(Math.max(20, startFreq), now);\\n  osc1.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(20, endFreq), now + duration);\\n\\n  // Secondary harmonic oscillator for organic liquid texture\\n  const osc2 = ctx.createOscillator();\\n  osc2.type = \'sine\';\\n  osc2.frequency.setValueAtTime(Math.max(20, startFreq * harmonicRatio), now);\\n  osc2.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(20, endFreq * harmonicRatio), now + duration);\\n\\n  const osc2Gain = ctx.createGain();\\n  osc2Gain.gain.setValueAtTime(harmonicGain, now);\\n\\n  // Connect graph\\n  osc1.connect(masterGain);\\n  osc2.connect(osc2Gain);\\n  osc2Gain.connect(masterGain);\\n  masterGain.connect(filter);\\n  filter.connect(ctx.destination);\\n\\n  osc1.start(now);\\n  osc2.start(now);\\n  osc1.stop(now + duration + 0.02);\\n  osc2.stop(now + duration + 0.02);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Launch / Budding Sound:\\n * Rising surface-tension stretch followed by an organic liquid detachment\\n */\\nexport function playLaunchSound() {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n  // Initial rising meniscus stretch tone\\n  playDropletTone({\\n    startFreq: 380,\\n    endFreq: 720,\\n    duration: 0.18,\\n    volume: 0.07,\\n    harmonicRatio: 1.6,\\n    harmonicGain: 0.15,\\n  });\\n\\n  // Delayed crisp snap / bloop as the neck detaches\\n  setTimeout(() => {\\n    playDropletTone({\\n      startFreq: 940,\\n      endFreq: 680,\\n      duration: 0.12,\\n      volume: 0.11,\\n      harmonicRatio: 1.95,\\n      harmonicGain: 0.25,\\n    });\\n  }, 220);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Neck Snap / Pinch-Off Sound:\\n * High-pitched delicate micro-bloop when liquid bridge separates\\n */\\nexport function playNeckSnapSound() {\\n  playDropletTone({\\n    startFreq: 1180,\\n    endFreq: 820,\\n    duration: 0.09,\\n    volume: 0.09,\\n    harmonicRatio: 2.1,\\n    harmonicGain: 0.2,\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Droplet Impact Sound (floor or wall bounce):\\n * Velocity-sensitive organic plop. Calmer speed = softer plop; higher speed = resonant splash.\\n */\\nexport function playImpactSound(speed: number, surface: \'bottom\' | \'wall\') {\\n  const now = performance.now();\\n  // Debounce rapid impacts to prevent audio chatter\\n  if (now - lastImpactTime < 90) return;\\n  lastImpactTime = now;\\n\\n  // Normalized speed factor (clamped)\\n  const normSpeed = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (speed - 40) / 900));\\n  const baseVolume = 0.03 + normSpeed * 0.12;\\n\\n  if (surface === \'bottom\') {\\n    // Floor landing: deeper, resonant liquid landing\\n    const startFreq = 480 - normSpeed * 80;\\n    const endFreq = 320 - normSpeed * 60;\\n    playDropletTone({\\n      startFreq,\\n      endFreq,\\n      duration: 0.11 + normSpeed * 0.05,\\n      volume: baseVolume,\\n      harmonicRatio: 1.7,\\n      harmonicGain: 0.18,\\n    });\\n  } else {\\n    // Wall bounce: crisp water slap / recoil\\n    const startFreq = 720 + normSpeed * 100;\\n    const endFreq = 510;\\n    playDropletTone({\\n      startFreq,\\n      endFreq,\\n      duration: 0.09 + normSpeed * 0.04,\\n      volume: baseVolume * 0.9,\\n      harmonicRatio: 1.85,\\n      harmonicGain: 0.2,\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Dock / Merge Sound:\\n * Gentle descending immersion as the droplet rejoins the taskbar liquid pool\\n */\\nexport function playMergeSound() {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n  // Soft descending bloop into the dock\\n  playDropletTone({\\n    startFreq: 820,\\n    endFreq: 410,\\n    duration: 0.16,\\n    volume: 0.12,\\n    harmonicRatio: 1.75,\\n    harmonicGain: 0.2,\\n  });\\n\\n  // Secondary sub-ripple for settling sensation\\n  setTimeout(() => {\\n    playDropletTone({\\n      startFreq: 390,\\n      endFreq: 260,\\n      duration: 0.18,\\n      volume: 0.06,\\n      harmonicRatio: 1.5,\\n      harmonicGain: 0.12,\\n    });\\n  }, 100);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Window Tap / Ripple Sound:\\n * Delicate crystal droplet bead chime inside the 1:1 window\\n */\\nexport function playRippleSound() {\\n  // Delicate high-pitched crystal drop\\n  const pitchVar = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 80;\\n  playDropletTone({\\n    startFreq: 1250 + pitchVar,\\n    endFreq: 920 + pitchVar,\\n    duration: 0.08,\\n    volume: 0.08,\\n    harmonicRatio: 2.05,\\n    harmonicGain: 0.22,\\n  });\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create Web Audio API synthesizer for tactile water droplet acoustics (launch, snap, impact, merge, ripple)\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/audio.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating audio utility\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create Web Audio API synthesizer\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\244%\n\241%\001i\024}\023\306\215\265K\243S\271\373\230\r\227\020\332W\224\267QdFJi\351\342\177\213\205Y\306u\223\021-\204\321\351\3048\377\212\307iAu/[\356\261\234A\271\216\2412u\231BD\326\331:\022\311\242\253\251\345)\300\203\3535\006\223E\304\255by\024a\234\334\246,6A\335+\254bh\201\201v\267\335f\002\302<z\311\274\212\332\363\303\027\345\026\2233\022\334\235;\300\337\210\313_|\242X\213\233&\253\206\344\235\312\360\370\367M\027\242\021\352\313n\320G\300\375L<\236\234\025d\236\241\025b\356\276\026\247\231\253\201`\220#\206lg\324Hh\223\201\330\227\301\350\312\255\004\005.j#\313_\240\260\373\365M\300wMz!\362o\215\301e\350\217\327\362R\002\253\241\343\205\364\037\031\033&}\264\301\360\366\355\244\004f\037+5Qm\204^T\242\372zc\243\262\\Ge]>\3554U\306(]\2344pc\026\331\361\375c\032\v2\3041\372\237\257\3257\356\021\265*|\362\231)k\336\a\337\252\253\235\017\362l6\210CK\237\264\b6\256G\334\365\"E\a\267\337\210\314\313\026\324\334\306\270A>\340\303Sd,\314pb\201\n&hq\373\2323\343\366#\277\356\223\235vS#\364\215\334\227\266G\205E&-\322[\334p\371\277U.\372\312M)\310\223\362to6\357PAztf\370J\310\244\366fu(\224g\276\204|J\350!L\324\223\325ee\"Pp\3601$f\366\255\027\372\352i\340RX\027\315\375~\333m\360\315\325\320\207F7\352-\030\315\"6\320\236\005\367E\347\327\345\r\374r\235E\233\003\214\344\001\211\003=\222\"B\251\036[p\356\314\256\033\365\332\002\006\213\204\256\2622\377\t\r\310\027\241g\254\351\'@\251\vE\000[\374\2134<\302\001\230lRC\264\312\"F\271T\0266\320\202f\216\234\241\215;\246\311\274N|g\306\353\271a\213\020?\n\253\032\f.\336\206>3I9qH\357\313J\202%\200S`oJ \362\341@x\223\213\340e\260,\244n\244\270$\3253*\003UR\242O\200O\2035\265\304\0218I\307\345\225Zi\241.\373\377JT\2278\032\222a\034\351a\227~.\257ZJ!\355\204\320\0244a\320Q^\357\302Fp\217\377\372\n\021\270\220(\226+\234\246X\252\273\357\a_[T\357\272\225n\001\b\236\005_\326\252es\363\241\274WPG\t4{\32246\vdZj\265\336\355f\277\2577\330\030\313!\353D\031\246\215\255N\376\361\367\377\001y\037\