  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Audio Implementations**\n\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating audio into the application. Specifically, I\'m importing a suite of sound functions, including those for launches, neck snaps, impacts, merges, and ripples from `./audio`. The next step is to integrate a boolean `hasSnappedRef` into `stateRef` to track audio-related events.\n\n\n**Implementing Sound Triggers**\n\nI\'ve been working on specific audio triggers now. I\'m focusing on ensuring the correct sounds play at the right moments. I\'m setting `state.hasSnapped` to `false` when `launchApp()` is called, and playing the neck snap during extruding. I\'m also preparing to add sounds for docking and collisions, using impact speed thresholds to determine which sound to play, and implementing sound events for clicks.\n\n\n"
