    thinking: "**Defining Audio Functions**\n\nI\'m currently working on incorporating audio feedback. I\'m focusing on `src/App.tsx`, where I\'ll import audio functions like `initAudioOnGesture`, `playLaunchSound`, and others to enhance the user experience. I also need to introduce a new state variable, `hasSnapped`, initialized as false, within `stateRef.current`. Next, I will be working on `launchApp`.\n\n\n**Implementing Audio Triggers**\n\nI\'ve added specific audio triggers to enhance different app states. The `playNeckSnapSound` function is called during the \'extruding\' phase, specifically when the progress reaches a certain threshold. I also integrated `playMergeSound` within the \'docking\' phase upon reaching completion. Furthermore, I\'ve incorporated `playImpactSound` to respond to collisions, taking into account impact speeds and directions. Specifically, the audio calls should include impact sounds from the top and bottom.\n\n\n**Refining Impact Acoustics**\n\nI\'m currently refining the impact sound integration, focusing on speed-dependent audio cues for collisions. I\'ve adjusted the impact sounds for wall collisions, incorporating `playImpactSound` calls. I also implemented `squashPower` calculations to control the intensity of the audio, and assigned it to the wall impacts.\n\n\n"
