  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Audio Implementation**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating audio initialization across several event handlers to ensure a responsive user experience. Specifically, I\'ve added `initAudioOnGesture()` to `handleWindowClick` and `handlePointerDown`. I\'ve also incorporated `playRippleSound()` within `handleWindowClick` to provide immediate feedback. Finally, I\'ve made changes to the secondary taskbar button\'s `onClick` to integrate it for audio initialization.\n\n\n"
