    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQmJgDWQcxcMG7wQCrTB2UwM_oabfJDX2_Hkg4n578iJKZk8MqBQQSJo_CIVOjhUgnIhOAFBODy9XGJMC5eRnD5hzjZdDttsJWdjpg17CR3bY2YiyZC_1rdyaPBLUvHrsexnGAqlip-DspSySf7im7gInm2U-fGUnjrj0UfWw76KaCbzKh_sIYmli_OIJTd3krI6cf7sqWqg=="
      title: "wikimedia.org"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGOA7JM0yuQ2YOKmsz4izh8BG99NvbqGgXyLPl7PpJOq4qxYndB_h61eCeGvQQkxahPJhrYG7wfrirhPcId4u3er_iRpk8UBTHhC0MZbLrIJ_vgGSlcDnIfHeJ8Fa12SCErWgy1VclRc6k-ck1rvpAciVA3Sd0="
      title: "wikimedia.org"
    }
    summary: "While Wikimedia Commons primarily hosts audio files in open formats like **OGG (.ogg)** and **WAV** instead of direct .mp3 files (due to open-source licensing standards), you can access free, direct CDN audio stream/download URLs for water drops and dripping sounds directly from their repository[1][2]. \n\nHere are notable examples of free water drop/dripping audio files on Wikimedia Commons along with their direct CDN media paths:\n\n### 1. Water Drops Dripping (Faucet/Bowl)\n* **Description:** Water dripping steadily from a faucet into a bowl of water[3].\n* **Format:** OGG Vorbis (easily converted to MP3 if needed)[3]\n* **License:** Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0[3]\n* **Direct CDN Audio URL:** \n  `https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/Water_drops_dripping.ogg`\n\n---\n\n### How to Find More on Wikimedia Commons:\nIf you need alternative variations (such as cavern drips, splashes, or single droplets), you can browse or query the media repository directly:\n* **Category Page:** [Wikimedia Commons: Sounds of Water](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Sounds_of_water)[1]\n* **Direct CDN Link Construction:** Files uploaded to Wikimedia Commons follow a predictable URL structure via `upload.wikimedia.org`. If you find a specific file name (e.g., `Filename.ogg`), its CDN path is typically structured as:\n  `https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/[first_hex]/[first_two_hex]/Filename.ogg`\n\nSources:\n[1] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGwS91L1pCxDaGTsGlChZKq5luXl0nM5PTYqt-BRGrpQljH0aH27yOOAy3LsL-hDpIzDv3HeYz5hPy9qawM9uCwEcRlH8TOu8RxSXQMchGgE55v2vr2kIMYWlQCdZ8iVIo-gcAVqAc8uLUMACq4f_c32Q==)\n[2] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQmJgDWQcxcMG7wQCrTB2UwM_oabfJDX2_Hkg4n578iJKZk8MqBQQSJo_CIVOjhUgnIhOAFBODy9XGJMC5eRnD5hzjZdDttsJWdjpg17CR3bY2YiyZC_1rdyaPBLUvHrsexnGAqlip-DspSySf7im7gInm2U-fGUnjrj0UfWw76KaCbzKh_sIYmli_OIJTd3krI6cf7sqWqg==)\n[3] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGOA7JM0yuQ2YOKmsz4izh8BG99NvbqGgXyLPl7PpJOq4qxYndB_h61eCeGvQQkxahPJhrYG7wfrirhPcId4u3er_iRpk8UBTHhC0MZbLrIJ_vgGSlcDnIfHeJ8Fa12SCErWgy1VclRc6k-ck1rvpAciVA3Sd0=)"
