  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Water Sounds**\n\nI\'ve been examining the water sounds in `src/soundAssets.ts`. It\'s pretty straightforward. We have six real water recordings, each with a unique character: a crisp drop, a studio-isolated drop, a high-pitched droplet, and a low-pitched resonant sound. It\'s a solid collection of raw assets to work with.\n\n\n**Implementing Audio Assets**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the audio assets. I\'m leveraging the Web Audio API with `AudioContext` and `decodeAudioData` to initialize and decode the base64 audio assets. I\'m also implementing a progressive enhancement: attempting to fetch `.mp3` files from the public directory, with base64 data URIs as a fallback. Decoded buffers will be stored in a dictionary.\nFor playback, I\'ll create `AudioBufferSourceNode`, setting the buffer and adjusting the `playbackRate` to introduce pitch variations. This will connect to a gain node for volume control, then to the context destination for audio output, starting the sound immediately.\n\n\n**Defining Sound Triggers**\n\nI\'ve just defined specific triggers and their associated sounds. For the launch, I\'ll play `dropLow` with a swell, then `droplet`. The neck snap uses `dropHigh` or `droplet`. Impact sounds vary; bottom impacts at high speeds use `splash` and `dropLow`, normal speeds use scaled `dropLow` or `dropSingle`. Wall impacts play a randomized `dropCrisp`. Merge sounds combine `dropLow` and `dropSingle`, and ripples use `dropHigh` or `dropCrisp`.\n\n\n**Confirming Data Decoding**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that `decodeAudioData` successfully decodes base64 data URIs and array buffers in the browser, using a simple and synchronous method. The data is converted to an `ArrayBuffer` and decoded into raw PCM `AudioBuffer`s. This approach is compatible across browsers, and even in Node.js or bun, making it ideal for my needs.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_964134592855997804"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\nimport {\\n  dropCrispBase64,\\n  dropSingleBase64,\\n  dropHighBase64,\\n  dropLowBase64,\\n  dropletBase64,\\n  splashBase64,\\n} from \'./soundAssets\';\\n\\n// Web Audio API engine for real recorded water acoustic playback\\nlet audioCtx: AudioContext | null = null;\\nconst audioBuffers: Record<string, AudioBuffer> = {};\\nconst decodingPromises: Record<string, Promise<AudioBuffer>> = {};\\nlet lastImpactTime = 0;\\n\\nfunction getAudioContext(): AudioContext | null {\\n  if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return null;\\n  if (!audioCtx) {\\n    const AudioContextClass =\\n      window.AudioContext ||\\n      (window as unknown as { webkitAudioContext: typeof AudioContext }).webkitAudioContext;\\n    if (AudioContextClass) {\\n      audioCtx = new AudioContextClass();\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (audioCtx && audioCtx.state === \'suspended\') {\\n    audioCtx.resume().catch(() => {});\\n  }\\n  return audioCtx;\\n}\\n\\n// Convert base64 Data URI to ArrayBuffer for Web Audio decoding\\nfunction dataUriToArrayBuffer(dataUri: string): ArrayBuffer {\\n  const base64Data = dataUri.split(\',\')[1];\\n  const binaryString = window.atob(base64Data);\\n  const len = binaryString.length;\\n  const bytes = new Uint8Array(len);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) {\\n    bytes[i] = binaryString.charCodeAt(i);\\n  }\\n  return bytes.buffer;\\n}\\n\\n// Load and decode a real recorded audio sound buffer\\nasync function loadSound(key: string, dataUri: string): Promise<AudioBuffer | null> {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return null;\\n  if (audioBuffers[key]) return audioBuffers[key];\\n\\n  if (!decodingPromises[key]) {\\n    decodingPromises[key] = (async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const arrayBuf = dataUriToArrayBuffer(dataUri);\\n        // decodeAudioData consumes the buffer, so slice to be safe\\n        const decoded = await ctx.decodeAudioData(arrayBuf.slice(0));\\n        audioBuffers[key] = decoded;\\n        return decoded;\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        console.warn(\'Failed to decode water audio:\', key, err);\\n        throw err;\\n      }\\n    })();\\n  }\\n\\n  return decodingPromises[key].catch(() => null);\\n}\\n\\n// Preload all real water recordings on first user gesture\\nexport function initAudioOnGesture() {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n  loadSound(\'crisp\', dropCrispBase64);\\n  loadSound(\'single\', dropSingleBase64);\\n  loadSound(\'high\', dropHighBase64);\\n  loadSound(\'low\', dropLowBase64);\\n  loadSound(\'droplet\', dropletBase64);\\n  loadSound(\'splash\', splashBase64);\\n}\\n\\n// Play a real recorded water sound with volume and pitch control\\nasync function playRealSound(options: {\\n  key: string;\\n  dataUri: string;\\n  volume?: number;\\n  pitch?: number;\\n  detuneRandom?: number;\\n}) {\\n  const ctx = getAudioContext();\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n  const {\\n    key,\\n    dataUri,\\n    volume = 0.5,\\n    pitch = 1.0,\\n    detuneRandom = 0.04,\\n  } = options;\\n\\n  let buffer = audioBuffers[key];\\n  if (!buffer) {\\n    buffer = (await loadSound(key, dataUri)) || undefined;\\n  }\\n  if (!buffer) return;\\n\\n  const now = ctx.currentTime;\\n  const source = ctx.createBufferSource();\\n  source.buffer = buffer;\\n\\n  // Organic pitch variation so repeated drops never sound robotic\\n  const pitchVar = 1.0 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * detuneRandom * 2;\\n  source.playbackRate.setValueAtTime(pitch * pitchVar, now);\\n\\n  const gainNode = ctx.createGain();\\n  gainNode.gain.setValueAtTime(volume, now);\\n\\n  source.connect(gainNode);\\n  gainNode.connect(ctx.destination);\\n\\n  source.start(now);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Launch / Budding Sound:\\n * Deep real water release as droplet extrudes and emerges from taskbar\\n */\\nexport function playLaunchSound() {\\n  initAudioOnGesture();\\n  // Deep organic water surge\\n  playRealSound({\\n    key: \'low\',\\n    dataUri: dropLowBase64,\\n    volume: 0.35,\\n    pitch: 0.95,\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Neck Snap / Pinch-Off Sound:\\n * Crisp real recorded water droplet snap when the surface tension bridge separates\\n */\\nexport function playNeckSnapSound() {\\n  initAudioOnGesture();\\n  playRealSound({\\n    key: \'high\',\\n    dataUri: dropHighBase64,\\n    volume: 0.45,\\n    pitch: 1.08,\\n    detuneRandom: 0.05,\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Droplet Impact Sound (floor, wall, ceiling):\\n * Real recorded water drops and splashes scaled dynamically to impact velocity\\n */\\nexport function playImpactSound(speed: number, surface: \'bottom\' | \'wall\') {\\n  const now = performance.now();\\n  if (now - lastImpactTime < 75) return;\\n  lastImpactTime = now;\\n\\n  initAudioOnGesture();\\n\\n  const normSpeed = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (speed - 40) / 950));\\n  const volume = 0.2 + normSpeed * 0.45;\\n\\n  if (surface === \'bottom\') {\\n    // Floor landing\\n    if (speed > 750) {\\n      // High-speed throw: real recorded splash sound!\\n      playRealSound({\\n        key: \'splash\',\\n        dataUri: splashBase64,\\n        volume: volume * 0.55,\\n        pitch: 1.05 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.1,\\n      });\\n    } else {\\n      // Normal floor impact: deep resonant real water droplet\\n      playRealSound({\\n        key: \'single\',\\n        dataUri: dropSingleBase64,\\n        volume: volume * 0.65,\\n        pitch: 0.9 + normSpeed * 0.2,\\n      });\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    // Wall / ceiling rebound: crisp real water droplet slap\\n    playRealSound({\\n      key: \'crisp\',\\n      dataUri: dropCrispBase64,\\n      volume: volume * 0.6,\\n      pitch: 0.95 + normSpeed * 0.18,\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Dock / Merge Sound:\\n * Real recorded water drop submerging back into the liquid dock\\n */\\nexport function playMergeSound() {\\n  initAudioOnGesture();\\n  // Deep authentic water drop absorption\\n  playRealSound({\\n    key: \'low\',\\n    dataUri: dropLowBase64,\\n    volume: 0.42,\\n    pitch: 0.88,\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Window Tap / Ripple Sound:\\n * Authentic sparkling droplet plink inside the 1:1 window\\n */\\nexport function playRippleSound() {\\n  initAudioOnGesture();\\n  playRealSound({\\n    key: \'droplet\',\\n    dataUri: dropletBase64,\\n    volume: 0.4,\\n    pitch: 1.0 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.08,\\n  });\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Replace synthetic sound effects with real recorded water sounds using decoded AudioBuffers\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/audio.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating audio module\",\"toolSummary\":\"Implement real recorded water audio playback\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\314!\n\311!\001i\024}\023&L^q\365\267\327\336\263\2162\236\266\203T\261\374\377\221\375\372\350:;\375\310h\001_\371p}\fM\034[\233\344\310&E\262\225\314\377\357C\2702\270\277\350o \371*\313\\\326\246v\257\022\310?J\346\215\200\0251D\341\242A\361Wuwwfo\001\0308Lt\362d\2622K\321+\276\215\315hJs\267i\311t\327\205\333\222\032\v&T\222I\274\2430\237\215I\251,\312O\344\375z(\026\202\021\326\\4unQ\361\322\244&\3304\006]o\r\"\036\277\237\b\vW\242$\320\362\360F\322K\213\273\266Q\317\220\v\005\031\267\3477Q\006qB\232K(\367\343+P\271\271)\346\265\237\201\355\265\v\242\tV\240\220!\233\343+N\307Z\304\233G=\352\221X\327\336i\306O1\207\354sB\r}\220\343n?\201\350\241\344=\251\227\210P\006s\303-g\376\360\330\374\374l\312Hl\273\350\215\317\354\255*LG\304,5F\255( [\260[\330\224\232\372\344\266k\251x\252w\274\261\216\243]j\224\260\361m7\302\372%\340p\223\367\r\221PGx3\243\350\252\223\322ROE)\020\337_\365WNgUK\324\236\315z/\220]nj\370\002\002\211B\264\0327\f\177.\252\3315\306\316\374\'S\253\031\256[\r\306\235\331|\250\361d\361(d7\266\240\311k\247?\371\200\272\232\320\352\2107\375t\3044_\342=t\200<O/6\017QyI\263\b\343AP\251\224N\017\357E\031\023\243vS\224z\247u\335\240\214\226\347\231\203g\t\253\f\305g\311.\231\277w<p:\225=Y\315\212\337+\224\252\'\245+\344\275\021C\333U\227\377pA\256\003\326`\273&\034F\221\213\334\3062G\207\347\374\371\375\021\267\370F[V\374L8\260sm\331\"\f\374\023\2569\306\034\200\311L\365n\355\263<\310\264\325\264\36212\b\006:A\203\b\340x1\023\225\354\205~s\002\224\032$Fzh$Q\256G^Q\341_`A\256\33680\316\317N8\350\326\326\'\240\204Ju\024\262h\343\037s\r\t\323\001\335p\244\315\3064x\210\363\375V_\262\214x\023t\035\367\224\330\215\236\227\347\262EP\367\276d\001\344Cr\347\027\357L\243\216\332X/\203\021Z\247\225`E\260\336\370Zj\016~\033w\2148\'\321\245\314CBJ\335\247X\rV\351O\372\352X\303\016\225\253\205j\241\240\373\215\023\263\301^\263\327\253y\025\211g\374\237\323\346\006S{J:\253\340\237\200C\376\350!\307\332\2330&\f\321\323gW\367\222\270|\24