    thinking: "**Addressing the Lint Error**\n\nI\'m currently focused on resolving a TypeScript lint error in `src/audio.ts`. The error on line 107 flags a type mismatch: `AudioBuffer | undefined` cannot be assigned to `AudioBuffer`. Specifically, the issue is related to how `source.buffer` is being handled. I\'m exploring the logic surrounding buffer assignment to ensure the value is always a valid `AudioBuffer` and not undefined.\n\n\n"
