  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Vapor Trail Emission**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the vapor trail emission logic within the RAF loop. Specifically, I\'m examining how the speed of a \"drop\" influences the emission interval of the vapor trail. The core logic involves calculating speed and then adjusting the `emitInterval` based on a speed threshold (360). I\'m looking at potential edge cases or optimizations for this speed-based adjustment.\n\n\n**Refining Trail Spawning**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down on the vapor particle spawning. Specifically, I\'m now examining the `trailDist` calculation, particularly concerning how trail distance influences particle spawn location. I\'m also exploring the impact of the randomized components in `spawnX` and `spawnY` on the overall visual effect, especially at higher speeds. Further, I am considering the logic concerning the impact of scale.\n\n\n**Evaluating Particle Dynamics**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the lifecycle and rendering of the vapor particles. I\'m focusing on the particle updates within the RAF loop, specifically how life, position, and velocity are modified. I am also thinking about how radius and opacity change over time, and if there are edge cases in the lifetime calculation. I am also making sure I am not exceeding the particle pool limits.\n\n\n**Assessing Trail Appearance**\n\nI\'m now examining the visual rendering, specifically how the opacity and radius of each particle are updated in the RAF loop, considering pre-rendered SVG circle elements. I\'m focusing on the effect of the fading opacity calculation and its impact on visual smoothness, considering the synchronization with the SVG circle attributes. I\'m also considering the radial gradient and soft white glare.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
