  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Vapor Trail Emission**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing vapor trails for objects in a \'floating\' state. My plan is to emit particles when an object\'s speed exceeds 350, specifically after position integration and collision checks. This feels like a good threshold for visual flair during high-speed movement or when an object is \"thrown\".\n\n\n**Refining Vapor Trail Dynamics**\n\nI\'ve been tweaking the vapor trail emission based on object speed. I\'m now dynamically calculating the emission interval, ensuring more frequent emissions at higher speeds. I also added a scale based on the speed of the object, so I\'m also now randomizing the trail particle\'s spawning position and base radius. The goal is to provide a more visually dynamic trail effect, while keeping the number of particles relatively optimized.\n\n\n"
