  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering SVG Placement**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the placement of the Vapor Trail SVG relative to the Liquid Neck SVG within the rendering structure. Lines 760-785 provide a potential guide, and I\'m exploring whether to position the Vapor Trail above or below the Liquid Neck to achieve the desired visual effect. I\'ll need to examine the z-index and how it impacts the layer ordering.\n\n\n**Analyzing Vapor Drop Gradient**\n\nI\'m now diving into the SVG\'s vapor drop gradient, specifically the radial gradient definition. I\'m focusing on how the color stops and blur filter impact the visual appearance of the vapor drops. I\'m observing the transparency and spread effect. It\'s really interesting to see how the combination of radial gradient and blur creates a soft, diffused look.\n\n\n"
