  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Contextual Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the `.card` and `.minimize-bead` elements. I\'ve integrated `onContextMenu` functionality, preventing default browser behavior and triggering the `handleEvaporate` function with the item\'s ID upon right-clicking. I intend to add double-click support next.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7247651028557996436"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add right click context menu and double-click trigger on droplet window for evaporation\",\"EndLine\":1005,\"Instruction\":\"Add onContextMenu to card and onDoubleClick to minimize-bead\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"          className=\\\"card\\\"\\n          onPointerDown={(e) => handlePointerDown(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerMove={(e) => handlePointerMove(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerUp={(e) => handlePointerUp(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerCancel={(e) => handlePointerUp(e, item.id)}\\n          onClick={(e) => handleWindowClick(e, item.id)}\\n          onContextMenu={(e) => {\\n            e.preventDefault();\\n            handleEvaporate(item.id);\\n          }}\\n        >\\n          {/* Minimize bead (merges app back into taskbar, or double-click to evaporate) */}\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Minimize into taskbar\\\"\\n            className=\\\"minimize-bead\\\"\\n            onClick={(e) => {\\n              e.stopPropagation();\\n              dockDroplet(item.id);\\n            }}\\n            onDoubleClick={(e) => {\\n              e.stopPropagation();\\n              handleEvaporate(item.id);\\n            }}\\n            onPointerDown={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\\n            title=\\\"Click to dock back to taskbar, or right-click to evaporate\\\"\\n          />\",\"StartLine\":984,\"TargetContent\":\"          className=\\\"card\\\"\\n          onPointerDown={(e) => handlePointerDown(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerMove={(e) => handlePointerMove(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerUp={(e) => handlePointerUp(e, item.id)}\\n          onPointerCancel={(e) => handlePointerUp(e, item.id)}\\n          onClick={(e) => handleWindowClick(e, item.id)}\\n        >\\n          {/* Minimize bead (merges app back into taskbar) */}\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Minimize into taskbar\\\"\\n            className=\\\"minimize-bead\\\"\\n            onClick={(e) => {\\n              e.stopPropagation();\\n              dockDroplet(item.id);\\n            }}\\n            onPointerDown={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\\n            title=\\\"Dock back to taskbar\\\"\\n          />\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding context menu evaporation handler to JSX\",\"toolSummary\":\"Support user right-click/double-click evaporation in JSX\"}"
